NOTE ON DATA — this licence covers the CODE in this repository only.

Files in `data/source/` were obtained from github.com/peterkirgis/llm-moral-foundations,
which carries no licence file. They are themselves transcriptions of a published table:
Clifford, Iyengar, Cabeza & Sinnott-Armstrong (2015), "Moral foundations vignettes,"
Behavior Research Methods 47(4):1178-1198, Table 1, pp. 1183-1186.

See data/source/PROVENANCE.md. Before any public redistribution, either re-derive the table
directly from the Clifford et al. article or seek clarification from the respective authors.
